# AbilityUtils.handleRemembering (AbilityUtils.java:1517-1530), run on the
# ability popped off the stack (MagicStack.java:646): Journey to Nowhere's ETB
# trigger names RememberTargets$ and ForgetOtherTargets$, so the targeted
# Bears are remembered on Journey before the trigger exiles them. Disenchant
# destroys Journey; its leaves-the-battlefield trigger returns Defined$
# Remembered -- the Bears, as a new object: untapped and summoning sick.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 W
tapformana human 4 W
queue paygeneric W
castspell human 1
queue targets 8
resolvestack
tapformana human 5 W
tapformana human 6 W
queue paygeneric W
queue targets 1
castspell human 2
resolvestack
